42,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, the downtime of the shared spectroscopy suite is indeed a critical issue. It's essential to have a backup plan or additional engineers to cover such instruments. @Midori, the increased animal-unit day rates might impact the budgeting for awards involving animal work. It's something we should consider during our deliberations.","{""words"":50,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
